Model weights in this repository

No original model weights are included. The delta.pt files hold replacement values for some of the
weights of the models below, so using them requires the original weights and is subject to those
models' licences.

- run3-gemma3-270m/best/H1-best-attempt/delta.pt modifies Gemma 3 270M IT (google/gemma-3-270m-it,
  revision ac82b4e820549b854eebf28ce6dedaf9fdfa17b3): replacement values for 4,976,785 of its
  parameters, written by GPT-6 Astra. It is a Model Derivative under the Gemma Terms of Use, and its
  use is subject to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy (ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).
- run2-gpt2/best/*/delta.pt modify GPT-2 small (openai-community/gpt2, revision
  607a30d783dfa663caf39e06633721c8d4cfcd7e), released by OpenAI and listed under the MIT licence.
- The checkpoints in run1-nanogpt-shakespeare/ come from a small model trained from scratch during
  run 1 on Shakespeare's plays.

